utiful Mughal Gardens, and experience the scenic beauty of Sonmarg, Gulmarg, and Pahalgam. Explore picturesque valleys, charming hill towns, and panoramic Himalayan views that create the perfect setting for romance, relaxation, and unforgettable memories.\n\nThoughtfully designed for newlyweds, this package combines romantic stays, comfortable transportation, and carefully curated sightseeing to offer an unforgettable honeymoon in one of the world\'s most beautiful destinations.',102,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-03 14:37:33.021'),('2c7713e7-0c7a-4010-a996-7f35039eeb37','himachal-complete-himachal-tour-package-10d9n','Complete Himachal Tour Package','Himachal Pradesh','domestic',9,10,'₹ 34,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785070263891-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-06-20-51-pm.png','[]','[\"Shimla &amp; Kufri\", \"Manali &amp; Solang Valley\", \"Atal Tunnel / Rohtang Pass\", \"Dharamshala\", \"Dalhousie &amp; Khajjiar\", \"Complete Himachal Experience\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Shimla\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Shimla and explore Mall Road, The Ridge and Christ Church.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Shimla Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kufri, Jakhoo Temple and nearby attractions.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Shimla to Manali\", \"detail\": \"Drive through Kullu Valley with sightseeing en route.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Manali Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Hadimba Temple, Vashisht Temple, Club House and Mall Road.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Solang Valley Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy Solang Valley, Atal Tunnel/Rohtang Pass and adventure activities.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Manali to Dharamshala\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Dharamshala and explore the local market.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Dharamshala Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Dalai Lama Temple, Bhagsunag Waterfall and Tea Gardens.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Dharamshala to Dalhousie\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Dalhousie and enjoy leisure time on Mall Road.\"}, {\"day\": 9, \"title\": \"Khajjiar Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore Khajjiar, Panchpula and Kalatop Wildlife Sanctuary.\"}, {\"day\": 10, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Explore the very best of Himachal Pradesh with our Complete Himachal Tour Package, an unforgettable journey through the state\'s most iconic hill stations, scenic valleys, spiritual landmarks, and adventure destinations.\n\nExperience the colonial elegance of Shimla, the snow-covered beauty of Manali, the peaceful monasteries of Dharamshala, and the charming landscapes of Dalhousie and Khajjiar. Discover breathtaking attractions including Solang Valley, Atal Tunnel or Rohtang Pass, Jakhoo Temple, Bhagsunag Waterfall, and the picturesque Kullu Valley while enjoying spectacular Himalayan views throughout your journey.\n\nPerfect for families, couples, and first-time visitors, this comprehensive package combines comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing, making it the ultimate way to experience the diverse beauty of Himachal Pradesh.',1104,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 12:51:08.688'),('2d901b42-0bfd-4083-9dfd-dc253a26785f','goa-goa-family-holiday-package-5d4n','‍‍‍ Goa Family Holiday Package','Goa','domestic',4,5,'₹ 18,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785072518683-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-06-58-22-pm.png','[]','[\"Fort Aguada\", \"Calangute Beach\", \"Baga Beach\", \"Basilica of Bom Jesus\", \"Miramar Beach\", \"Panjim City\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Goa\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Goa and spend a relaxing evening at the beach.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"North Goa Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Fort Aguada, Calangute Beach, Baga Beach and Anjuna Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"South Goa Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Basilica of Bom Jesus, Se Cathedral, Dona Paula and Miramar Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Leisure &amp; Shopping\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy local markets, optional water sports and beachside relaxation.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Create unforgettable family memories with our Goa Family Holiday Package, designed to offer the perfect balance of relaxation, sightseeing, and fun-filled experiences for travelers of all ages.\n\nExplore Goa\'s most loved attractions, including Fort Aguada, Calangute Beach, Baga Beach, Basilica of Bom Jesus, Miramar Beach, and the vibrant streets of Panjim. Spend quality time together enjoying scenic beaches, cultural landmarks, local shopping, and optional adventure activities while experiencing the warm hospitality and laid-back charm that Goa is famous for.\n\nWhether you\'re travelling with children, parents, or extended family, this package offers comfortable accommodation, delicious meals, private transportation, and carefully planned sightseeing for a stress-free and memorable family vacation.',1404,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 13:28:40.842'),('34b836e7-c122-46ba-93f1-ff506345e004','dirang-bomdila-tawang-tour-6d5n','Dirang – Bomdila – Tawang Tour','Arunachal Pradesh','domestic',5,6,'₹ 25,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785085533459-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-10-34-40-pm.png','[]','[\"Bomdila Monastery\", \"Dirang Valley\", \"Sela Pass\", \"Tawang Monastery\", \"Madhuri Lake\", \"Nuranang Waterfall\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Guwahati – Bomdila\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Bomdila while enjoying mountain landscapes.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Bomdila to Dirang\", \"detail\": \"Visit Bomdila Monastery and continue to the picturesque Dirang Valley.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Dirang to Tawang\", \"detail\": \"Cross Sela Pass and visit Jaswant Garh War Memorial en route.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Tawang Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Tawang Monastery, War Memorial and local attractions.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Madhuri Lake Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Visit Madhuri Lake and nearby Himalayan viewpoints before returning to Tawang.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"Begin your return journey to Guwahati/Tezpur.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the breathtaking landscapes of Arunachal Pradesh with our Dirang – Bomdila – Tawang Tour, a scenic journey through charming mountain towns, ancient monasteries, pristine valleys, and spectacular Himalayan passes.\n\nExplore the peaceful surroundings of Bomdila Monastery, admire the lush beauty of Dirang Valley, and journey across the breathtaking Sela Pass before reaching the enchanting town of Tawang. Visit the magnificent Tawang Monastery, the serene Madhuri Lake, the historic Jaswant Garh War Memorial, and the picturesque Nuranang Waterfall while soaking in the untouched beauty of India\'s eastern frontier.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, photographers, and mountain enthusiasts, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and carefully planned sightseeing for an unforgettable Arunachal Pradesh experience.',701,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-29 14:42:53.049'),('35d49770-9a33-4419-a706-12dc588fff13','andaman-andaman-honeymoon-special-5d4n','Andaman Honeymoon Special','Andaman Islands','domestic',4,5,'₹ 29,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785071135163-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-06-35-24-pm.png','[]','[\"4 Nights Accommodation\", \"Daily Breakfast\", \"Romantic Room Decoration (One Time)\", \"Private Ferry Transfers\", \"Private AC Vehicle for Sightseeing\", \"Airport Pickup &amp; Drop\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Port Blair\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Port Blair, visit Cellular Jail and enjoy the Light &amp; Sound Show.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Port Blair to Havelock Island\", \"detail\": \"Transfer to Havelock Island and relax at the world-famous Radhanagar Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Havelock Exploration\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy Elephant Beach, optional scuba diving, snorkeling and romantic leisure time.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Return to Port Blair\", \"detail\": \"Return by ferry and explore local markets and waterfront.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Port Blair Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Celebrate your love amidst the breathtaking beauty of the Andaman Islands with our Andaman Romantic Escape, a honeymoon specially designed around crystal-clear waters, white sandy beaches, and unforgettable island experiences.\n\nRelax on the world-famous Radhanagar Beach, spend quality time on the picturesque Havelock Island (Swaraj Dweep), and enjoy magical sunsets along one of Asia\'s most beautiful coastlines. Explore the historic Cellular Jail, indulge in optional activities like scuba diving and snorkeling, and create lifelong memories with romantic beach stays, private ferry transfers, and peaceful island surroundings.\n\nThoughtfully curated for honeymooners and couples, this package combines romantic accommodation, scenic sightseeing, and seamless travel arrangements for the perfect tropical honeymoon.',1501,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 13:05:39.044'),('36732c73-37e4-4e65-8b12-ba63ef2c9fe9','west-bengal-kolkata-digha-coastal-holiday-5d4n','Kolkata – Digha Coastal Holiday','West Bengal','domestic',4,5,'₹ 18,499',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785228358608-chatgpt-image-jul-28-2026-02-15-46-pm.png','[]','[\"Victoria Memorial\", \"Howrah Bridge\", \"Digha Beach\", \"New Digha Beach\", \"Mandarmani Beach\", \"Marine Aquarium\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Kolkata\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Kolkata and visit Victoria Memorial, Howrah Bridge and Park Street.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Kolkata to Digha\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Digha and enjoy the beach with a beautiful sunset.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Digha Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit New Digha Beach, Marine Aquarium and Amarabati Park.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Mandarmani Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore Mandarmani Beach and enjoy leisure by the sea before returning to Digha.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, return to Kolkata for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Enjoy a perfect coastal getaway with our Kolkata and Digha tour, combining cultural heritage with relaxing beach experiences.\n\nExplore iconic landmarks of Kolkata such as Victoria Memorial and Howrah Bridge, along with the scenic beaches of Digha and Mandarmani.\n\nRelax by the sea, enjoy beautiful sunsets, and experience the perfect mix of city life and coastal charm.\n\nPerfect for families and leisure travelers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, smooth transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for a refreshing holiday experience.',2302,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 08:46:01.742'),('377e69f6-f3ec-4d23-899a-9a0c5d6c0e44','maharashtra-shirdi-shani-shingnapur-spiritual-tour-3d2n','Shirdi – Shani Shingnapur Spiritual Tour','Maharashtra','domestic',2,3,'₹ 10,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785080880246-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-09-17-48-pm.png','[]','[\"Sai Baba Samadhi Temple\", \"Dwarkamai\", \"Chavadi\", \"Shani Shingnapur Temple\", \"Sai Heritage Village\", \"Lendi Baug\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Shirdi\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Shirdi, visit Sai Baba Samadhi Temple, Dwarkamai, Chavadi and attend the evening Aarti.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Shani Shingnapur Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Visit Shani Shingnapur Temple, Sai Heritage Village and Lendi Baug before returning to Shirdi.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on a spiritually fulfilling journey with our Shirdi – Shani Shingnapur Divine Tour, a sacred pilgrimage that brings together two of Maharashtra\'s most revered religious destinations.\n\nSeek blessings at the holy Sai Baba Samadhi Temple while exploring sacred landmarks such as Dwarkamai, Chavadi, Lendi Baug, and Sai Heritage Village. Continue your spiritual journey to the famous Shani Shingnapur Temple, renowned for its unique traditions and deep religious significance. Every destination offers an atmosphere of devotion, peace, and timeless faith.\n\nIdeal for pilgrims, families, and spiritual seekers, this package includes comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and carefully planned sightseeing for a peaceful and memorable pilgrimage experience.',1803,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:48:07.492'),('399a02d8-8486-4ac3-a491-92197e70de86','madhya-pradesh-ujjain-spiritual-tour-package-3d2n','Ujjain Spiritual Tour Package','Madhya Pradesh','domestic',2,3,'₹ 8,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785079315707-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-51-44-pm.png','[]','[\"Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga Darshan\", \"Mahakal Lok Corridor\", \"Kal Bhairav Temple\", \"Harsiddhi Mata Temple\", \"Ram Ghat &amp; Shipra River\", \"Private Cab with Sightseeing\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Ujjain\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Ujjain, visit Mahakaleshwar Temple, Bade Ganeshji Ka Mandir and Mahakal Lok before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Ujjain Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kal Bhairav Temple, Harsiddhi Mata Temple, Mangalnath Temple, Ram Ghat and other famous temples before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, visit local markets (if time permits) and proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on a soul-enriching journey with our Ujjain Spiritual Tour Package, a sacred pilgrimage to one of India\'s holiest cities, renowned for its ancient temples, divine traditions, and timeless spiritual heritage.\n\nSeek blessings at the revered Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga, one of the twelve sacred Jyotirlingas of Lord Shiva, and walk through the magnificent Mahakal Lok Corridor, a remarkable spiritual and architectural landmark. Visit the revered Kal Bhairav Temple, Harsiddhi Mata Temple, Mangalnath Temple, and the holy Ram Ghat on the banks of the Shipra River, where centuries-old rituals continue to inspire devotees from across the world.\n\nPerfect for pilgrims, families, and spiritual seekers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for a peaceful and memorable pilgrimage experience.',900,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:22:03.948'),('3b1df3cf-3b75-4f1a-91b7-a3fca9195fe2','guwahati-kaziranga-tour-5d4n','Guwahati & Kaziranga Tour','Assam','domestic',4,5,'₹ 19,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785081885164-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-09-34-32-pm.png','[]','[\"Kamakhya Temple\", \"Umananda Temple\", \"Brahmaputra River Cruise\", \"Kaziranga National Park\", \"Jeep Safari\", \"Assam Tea Gardens\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Guwahati\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Guwahati and visit Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Temple and Brahmaputra Riverfront.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Guwahati to Kaziranga\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Kaziranga while visiting tea gardens and local villages.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Kaziranga Wildlife Safari\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy jeep safari, Orchid Park and explore the rich biodiversity of Kaziranga.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Return to Guwahati\", \"detail\": \"Visit Srimanta Sankardev Kalakshetra, local markets and enjoy an evening Brahmaputra River Cruise.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed to Guwahati Airport/Railway Station.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the perfect blend of spirituality, wildlife, and culture with our Guwahati & Kaziranga Tour, a memorable holiday showcasing Assam\'s most iconic attractions.\n\nBegin your journey in Guwahati by seeking blessings at the revered Kamakhya Temple and visiting the peaceful Umananda Temple before enjoying a scenic cruise on the mighty Brahmaputra River. Continue to the renowned Kaziranga National Park for an exciting jeep safari through its rich wildlife habitats, while exploring lush tea gardens, Orchid Park, and experiencing the vibrant traditions of Assamese culture along the way.\n\nIdeal for families, pilgrims, wildlife enthusiasts, and first-time visitors, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for a truly enriching Assam experience.',401,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-29 14:42:02.693'),('3bcb40f1-b380-445f-9c3c-43b7564056ef','kerala-kerala-family-holiday-6d5n','‍‍‍ Kerala Family Holiday','Kerala','domestic',5,6,'₹ 21,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1783235048343-kerala-family-holiday.png','[]','[\"Kochi\", \"Munnar\", \"Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary\", \"Alleppey Houseboat\", \"Marine Drive\", \"Kathakali Show\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Kochi\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Kochi and visit Fort Kochi, Chinese Fishing Nets, Marine Drive and Mattancherry Palace.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Kochi to Munnar\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Munnar while visiting waterfalls and tea plantations.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Munnar Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Eravikulam National Park, Tea Museum, Mattupetty Dam and Echo Point.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Munnar to Thekkady\", \"detail\": \"Explore Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary, Spice Plantation and boating at Periyar Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Thekkady to Alleppey\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy a relaxing houseboat cruise through Kerala\'s famous backwaters.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive back to Kochi for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Create unforgettable memories with your loved ones on our Kerala Family Holiday, a delightful journey that showcases the very best of God\'s Own Country through scenic hill stations, wildlife adventures, tranquil backwaters, and vibrant cultural experiences.\n\nExplore the historic charm of Kochi, admire the breathtaking landscapes of Munnar, encounter nature at Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary, and unwind aboard a traditional Alleppey houseboat as you cruise through Kerala\'s serene backwaters. From lush tea plantations to cultural performances and family-friendly attractions, every destination offers something special for travelers of all ages.\n\nIdeal for families seeking relaxation, adventure, and quality time together, this package combines comfortable accommodation, delicious meals, private transportation, and well-planned sightseeing for a truly memorable Kerala vacation.',302,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-25 10:56:37.915'),('4310ccf0-3f24-4ded-b336-9d84e417d527','gujarat-complete-gujarat-grand-discovery-tour-9d8n','Complete Gujarat Grand Discovery Tour','Gujarat','domestic',6,7,'₹ 26,499',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785073778555-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-19-26-pm.png','[]','[\"Dwarkadhish Temple\", \"Somnath Jyotirlinga\", \"Gir National Park Safari\", \"White Rann of Kutch\", \"Statue of Unity\", \"Diu Beach\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Ahmedabad to Diu\", \"detail\": \"Early morning departure from Ahmedabad and drive to Diu. Visit Diu Fort, Naida Caves and relax at Nagoa Beach while enjoying the beautiful coastal sunset. Overnight stay in Diu.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Diu Sightseeing, Gir Safari &amp; Somnath\", \"detail\": \"Explore St. Paul\'s Church and Gangeshwar Mahadev Temple before proceeding to Gir National Park for an exciting wildlife safari. Later, drive to Somnath and enjoy the Light &amp; Sound Show (subject to operational timings). Overnight stay in Somnath.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Somnath to Dwarka\", \"detail\": \"Visit Somnath Jyotirlinga, Triveni Sangam and Bhalka Tirth before driving to Dwarka. Attend the evening Aarti at Dwarkadhish Temple. Overnight stay in Dwarka.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Dwarka Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Dwarkadhish Temple, Bet Dwarka, Nageshwar Jyotirlinga, Rukmini Devi Temple and Gomti Ghat. Overnight stay in Dwarka.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Dwarka to Dholavira\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive to Dholavira. Explore the UNESCO World Heritage archaeological site and witness the breathtaking sunset over the White Rann of Kutch. Overnight stay in Dholavira.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"White Rann of Kutch Experience\", \"detail\": \"Spend the day exploring the White Rann, nearby attractions and local handicrafts while experiencing the unique culture of Kutch. Overnight stay in Dholavira.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Bhuj Sightseeing &amp; Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive towards Ahmedabad via Bhuj. Visit Aina Mahal, Prag Mahal and the Bhuj Local Market before continuing your journey to Ahmedabad for your onward departure.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the very best of Gujarat with our Complete Gujarat Grand Discovery Tour, an unforgettable journey that showcases the state\'s rich spiritual heritage, incredible wildlife, pristine beaches, vibrant culture, and world-famous landmarks.\n\nSeek blessings at the sacred Dwarkadhish Temple and Somnath Jyotirlinga, experience the thrill of a safari in Gir National Park, relax on the beautiful beaches of Diu, witness the mesmerizing White Rann of Kutch, and admire the grandeur of the iconic Statue of Unity. From ancient temples and historic coastal towns to spectacular desert landscapes and modern architectural marvels, every destination offers a unique glimpse into Gujarat\'s remarkable diversity.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, pilgrims, and first-time visitors, this comprehensive package combines comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing, making it the ultimate way to experience the cultural and natural wonders of Gujarat.',1205,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-02 09:50:00.044'),('43e10f7a-8ff2-4745-ab07-9c5e9b4343b7','odisha-bhubaneswar-puri-gopalpur-beach-holiday-6d5n','Bhubaneswar – Puri – Gopalpur Beach Holiday','Odisha','domestic',5,6,'₹ 21,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/pac