detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the best of Tamil Nadu with our complete grand tour, an immersive journey through heritage cities, sacred temples, and stunning coastal landscapes.\n\nExplore Chennai’s vibrant city life, the UNESCO monuments of Mahabalipuram, the French charm of Pondicherry, and the spiritual depth of Madurai and Rameswaram.\n\nWitness the iconic Pamban Bridge, experience the serenity of Dhanushkodi, and enjoy breathtaking sunrise and sunset views at Kanyakumari.\n\nPerfect for travelers seeking a complete South India experience, this package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless transport, and expertly planned sightseeing for an unforgettable journey.',205,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-25 11:38:57.224'),('62f71572-d012-494b-a65c-dd489de55469','kashmir-premium-kashmir-honeymoon-with-vaishno-devi-9d8n','Premium Kashmir Romance & Vaishno Devi Retreat','Kashmir','domestic',8,9,'₹ 34,499',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785075680457-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-51-03-pm.png','[]','[\"Deluxe Houseboat Stay\", \"Romantic Shikara Ride\", \"Sonmarg Stay\", \"2 Nights Gulmarg Stay\", \"2 Nights Pahalgam Stay\", \"Vaishno Devi Darshan\", \"Srinagar Shopping\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Jammu Arrival – Srinagar Houseboat Stay\", \"detail\": \"Arrive at Jammu Railway Station or Airport and proceed to Srinagar. Visit Nishat Bagh, Shalimar Bagh, Chashme Shahi, and Pari Mahal. Enjoy a romantic Shikara Ride on Dal Lake. Dinner and overnight stay in Deluxe Houseboat.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Srinagar to Sonmarg\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed to Sonmarg. Explore the valley, Sindh River, and surrounding snow-capped mountains. Enjoy leisure time amidst nature. Dinner and overnight stay in Sonmarg.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Sonmarg to Gulmarg\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive to Gulmarg. Explore scenic meadows and enjoy optional Gondola activities. Dinner and overnight stay in 