s that offer an unforgettable encounter with nature.\n\nPerfect for families, nature lovers, and wildlife enthusiasts, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, guided sightseeing, and an exciting jungle safari for a truly unforgettable Uttarakhand holiday.',2202,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 08:57:42.732'),('721cfbeb-d444-4ceb-9246-644c25e1a3e8','ladakh-leh-nubra-valley-pangong-lake-tour-7d6n','Leh – Nubra Valley – Pangong Lake Tour','Ladakh','domestic',6,7,'₹ 29,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785076863216-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-09-15-pm.png','[]','[\"Khardung La Pass\", \"Nubra Valley\", \"Pangong Lake\", \"Diskit Monastery\", \"Hunder Sand Dunes &amp; Camel Safari\", \"Leh Local Sightseeing\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Leh\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Leh, acclimatize to the high altitude and explore Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Leh Local Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Leh Palace, Hall of Fame, Magnetic Hill, Sangam and Gurudwara Pathar Sahib.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Leh to Nubra Valley\", \"detail\": \"Drive via Khardung La Pass, visit Diskit Monastery and Hunder Sand Dunes.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake\", \"detail\": \"Travel through the scenic Shyok Route and enjoy the mesmerizing beauty of Pangong Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Pangong Lake to Leh\", \"detail\": \"Witness the sunrise at Pangong Lake before returning to Leh via Chang La Pass.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Leisure &amp; Shopping\", \"detail\": \"Spend the day exploring Leh Market, Tibetan Market and local cafés.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Leh Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the very best of Ladakh with our Leh – Nubra Valley – Pangong Lake Expedition, an unforgettable journey through towering mountain passes, breathtaking valleys, crystal-clear lakes, and some of the most spectacular landscapes in the Himalayas.\n\nTravel across the legendary Khardung La Pass to the scenic Nubra Valley, visit the peaceful Diskit Monastery, and enjoy a memorable camel safari across the Hunder Sand Dunes. Continue through the picturesque Shyok Valley to the world-famous Pangong Lake, where shimmering blue waters surrounded by rugged mountains create one of India\'s most iconic travel experiences. Explore Leh\'s historic landmarks, monasteries, and vibrant local markets along the way.\n\nIdeal for families, honeymooners, couples, and adventure lovers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing for an extraordinary Ladakh adventure.',1000,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 14:41:18.686'),('72dfa644-032d-4723-a736-dd198b92fad7','uttar-pradesh-complete-uttar-pradesh-grand-tour-9d8n','Complete Uttar Pradesh Grand Tour','Uttarpradesh','domestic',8,9,'₹ 31,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785231597914-chatgpt-image-jul-28-2026-03-09-43-pm.png','[]','[\"Shri Ram Janmabhoomi\", \"Kashi Vishwanath Temple\", \"Triveni Sangam\", \"Taj Mahal\", \"Prem Mandir &amp; Banke Bihari Temple\", \"Evening Ganga Aarti\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Ayodhya\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Ayodhya and visit Shri Ram Janmabhoomi, Hanuman Garhi and Kanak Bhawan.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Ayodhya to Prayagraj\", \"detail\": \"Visit Triveni Sangam, Hanuman Temple and Anand Bhavan.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Prayagraj to Varanasi\", \"detail\": \"Proceed to Varanasi and witness the evening Ganga Aarti at Dashashwamedh Ghat.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Varanasi Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kashi Vishwanath Temple, Sarnath, Kaal Bhairav Temple and enjoy a boat ride on the Ganges.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Varanasi to Agra\", \"detail\": \"Travel to Agra and enjoy a relaxing evening.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Agra Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore the Taj Mahal, Agra Fort and Meht