ation.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the charm of the Eastern Himalayas with our Gangtok Delight, a refreshing holiday that combines breathtaking mountain landscapes, peaceful monasteries, scenic viewpoints, and the vibrant culture of Sikkim\'s capital city.\n\nExplore the picturesque streets of Gangtok while visiting the serene Rumtek Monastery, the panoramic Tashi View Point, and the beautiful Banjhakri Falls. Witness the crystal-clear waters of the iconic Tsomgo Lake, seek blessings at Baba Harbhajan Singh Mandir, and spend leisurely evenings strolling through the lively MG Marg, known for its cafés, shopping, and vibrant atmosphere.\n\nPerfect for families, couples, and leisure travelers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for a relaxing Himalayan getaway.',600,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-29 14:42:22.140'),('7943cda5-a050-486c-912a-b7280868aa84','complete-sikkim-explorer-featured-package-7d6n','Complete Sikkim Explorer','Sikkim','domestic',6,7,'₹ 31,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785083731572-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-10-05-16-pm.png','[]','[\"Gangtok\", \"Tsomgo Lake\", \"Nathula Pass\", \"Baba Mandir\", \"Lachung\", \"Yumthang Valley\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Gangtok\", \"detail\": \"Arrive at Bagdogra/NJP and transfer to Gangtok.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Gangtok Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Rumtek Monastery, Tashi View Point and MG Marg.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Tsomgo Lake &amp; Nathula Pass\", \"detail\": \"Explore Tsomgo Lake, Baba Mandir and Nathula Pass (permit applicable).\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Gangtok to Lachung\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Lachung through beautiful Himalayan landscapes.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Yumthang Valley Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Visit Yumthang Valley and Snow Point (seasonal).\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Return to Gangtok\", \"detail\": \"Return to Gangtok and enjoy shopping and leisure.\"}, {\"day\": 