ner.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Agatti Exploration\", \"detail\": \"Explore Agatti village, beaches and local island life.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Agatti Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Celebrate the beginning of your new journey together with our Lakshadweep Honeymoon Retreat, a romantic island escape surrounded by turquoise lagoons, secluded beaches, luxurious resorts, and unforgettable tropical experiences.\n\nRelax amidst the pristine beauty of Agatti and Bangaram Islands, where crystal-clear waters, soft white sands, and breathtaking sunsets create the perfect backdrop for romance. Enjoy a magical sunset cruise, explore vibrant coral reefs through snorkeling, indulge in a romantic candlelight dinner by the beach, and create lifelong memories in one of India\'s most secluded island destinations.\n\nThoughtfully designed for honeymooners and couples, this package combines romantic accommodation, exclusive honeymoon experiences, seamless island transfers, and carefully curated sightseeing for an unforgettable tropical honeymoon.',1601,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:08:11.528'),('81823095-6dda-497f-b2bb-6dd3c0792f8f','goa-south-goa-serenity-escape-4d3n','South Goa Serenity Escape','Goa','domestic',3,4,'₹ 12,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785071786773-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-06-46-13-pm.png','[]','[\"Butterfly Beach\", \"Palolem Beach\", \"Agonda Beach\", \"Cabo de Rama Fort\", \"Basilica of Bom Jesus\", \"Dona Paula View Point\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in South Goa\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Goa, check in to your hotel and relax at the beach while exploring nearby local markets.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Heritage Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Basilica of Bom Jesus, Se Cathedral, Dona Paula View Point, Miramar Beach and Panjim.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"South Goa Beaches\", \"detail\": \"Explore Butterfly Beach, Palolem Beach, Agonda Beach,