t Nagoa Beach. Overnight stay in Diu.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Diu Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Naida Caves, St. Paul\'s Church and Gangeshwar Mahadev Temple. Spend the evening relaxing by the beach or exploring the local market. Overnight stay in Diu.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Departure to Ahmedabad\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive back to Ahmedabad for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the perfect blend of heritage, spirituality, and coastal relaxation with our Gujarat Coastal Heritage & Diu Beach Escape, a refreshing holiday showcasing Gujarat\'s scenic coastline and the charming island town of Diu.\n\nBegin your journey with the divine blessings of the revered Somnath Jyotirlinga before exploring Diu\'s Portuguese heritage through iconic attractions like Diu Fort, St. Paul\'s Church, and the fascinating Naida Caves. Relax on the pristine shores of Nagoa Beach, witness breathtaking sunsets over the Arabian Sea, and enjoy leisurely moments amidst peaceful coastal surroundings and vibrant local markets.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, and leisure travelers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and carefully curated sightseeing for an unforgettable coastal escape.',1202,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-02 09:30:53.639'),('84bb3136-34e8-4a71-b572-e5831f6a6bf3','rajasthan-jaipur-heritage-tour-package-3d2n','Jaipur Heritage Tour Package','Rajasthan','domestic',2,3,'₹ 8,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785087133360-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-11-01-56-pm.png','[]','[\"Amber Fort\", \"Hawa Mahal\", \"City Palace\", \"Jantar Mantar\", \"Nahargarh Fort\", \"Jal Mahal &amp; Patrika Gate\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Jaipur\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Jaipur, visit Hawa Mahal, City Palace, Jantar Mantar and local markets before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Jaipur Fort Tour\", \"detail\": \"Explore Amber Fort, Jaigarh Fort, Nahargarh Fort, Jal Mahal and Patrika Gate before