ion\", \"Gulmarg Excursion\", \"Pahalgam Excursion\", \"Shopping in Srinagar\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Srinagar\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Srinagar, visit Mughal Gardens and enjoy a Shikara Ride on Dal Lake. Overnight stay in Srinagar.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Sonmarg Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore the scenic beauty of Sonmarg and its surrounding valleys before returning to Srinagar for an overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Gulmarg Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Visit Gulmarg, enjoy its lush meadows and optional Gondola Ride, then return to Srinagar for an overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Pahalgam Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore Betaab Valley, Aru Valley, Chandanwari and the picturesque Lidder River before returning to Srinagar.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Srinagar Sightseeing &amp; Departure\", \"detail\": \"Visit Lal Chowk and Polo View Market for shopping before transferring to Srinagar Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Create unforgettable moments with your loved ones on our Kashmir Family Tour Package, a relaxing journey through Kashmir\'s most scenic valleys, charming hill stations, and timeless natural beauty.\n\nExplore the picturesque city of Srinagar, glide across the tranquil waters of Dal Lake on a traditional Shikara ride, and visit the breathtaking destinations of Sonmarg, Gulmarg, and Pahalgam. Admire snow-covered mountains, lush green meadows, crystal-clear rivers, and colorful local markets while experiencing the warm hospitality and peaceful atmosphere that make Kashmir one of India\'s most loved family destinations.\n\nDesigned especially for families, this package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing, ensuring a hassle-free vacation filled with unforgettable experiences.',101,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-02 11:39:54.217'),('8bd093f6-de89-43b7-ae96-5d672003dfc9','odisha-odisha-wildlife-nature-expedition-trending-6d