9de4dca3d1e6','kerala-backwater-honeymoon-5d4n','Kerala Backwater Honeymoon','Kerala','domestic',4,5,'₹ 22,499',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1783010199186-kerala-backwater.png','[]','[\"Munnar &amp; Thekkady stays\", \"Alleppey houseboat night\", \"Daily breakfast + dinner\", \"All transfers in private cab\", \"Spice plantation tour\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Cochin → Munnar\", \"detail\": \"Drive through tea estates, check-in at hill resort.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Munnar sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Mattupetty dam, Echo point, Eravikulam national park.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Munnar → Thekkady\", \"detail\": \"Periyar lake cruise &amp; spice plantation visit.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Alleppey houseboat\", \"detail\": \"Cruise the backwaters with onboard chef &amp; cabin stay.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Cochin airport for return.\"}]',1,1,NULL,'Celebrate the beginning of your new journey together with our Kerala Romantic Escape, a dreamy honeymoon crafted amidst Kerala\'s misty hills, lush spice plantations, tranquil backwaters, and breathtaking natural beauty.\n\nBegin your romantic escape in the picturesque tea gardens of Munnar before exploring the serene landscapes of Thekkady, home to the famous Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary and aromatic spice plantations. Complete your honeymoon with an unforgettable overnight stay aboard a traditional Alleppey houseboat, where peaceful backwaters, spectacular sunsets, and a romantic candlelight dinner create memories to cherish forever.\n\nThoughtfully designed for newlyweds, this package offers premium accommodation, private transportation, exclusive honeymoon inclusions, and carefully planned sightseeing, making it the perfect beginning to your lifelong journey together.',2,'2026-06-26 21:32:25.493','2026-08-06 14:47:10.190'),('8d4c56c5-fd16-4954-9462-16384fcc09c0','odisha-golden-triangle-of-odisha-5d4n','Golden Triangle of Odisha','Odisha','domestic',4,5,'₹ 17,