rrival in Bandhavgarh\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Bandhavgarh, check in and relax before your wildlife adventure begins.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Bandhavgarh Safari\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy an exciting jungle safari and explore the rich wildlife of Bandhavgarh National Park.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Bandhavgarh to Kanha\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Kanha National Park and spend the evening at leisure amidst beautiful forest surroundings.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Kanha Safari\", \"detail\": \"Experience an early morning jungle safari and discover the diverse flora and fauna of Kanha National Park.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Kanha Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore nearby nature trails and local attractions before enjoying your final evening in Kanha.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed to Jabalpur Airport/Railway Station for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on an unforgettable wildlife adventure with our Bandhavgarh & Kanha Wildlife Expedition, a thrilling journey through two of India\'s most celebrated tiger reserves and pristine forest landscapes.\n\nExperience exciting jungle safaris in Bandhavgarh National Park and Kanha National Park, home to majestic Bengal tigers, leopards, deer, sloth bears, and an incredible variety of birdlife. Explore lush forests, scenic grasslands, and peaceful wilderness while enjoying close encounters with nature in some of Central India\'s most spectacular wildlife destinations.\n\nIdeal for adventure seekers, wildlife enthusiasts, photographers, and families, this package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and expertly planned safari experiences for an unforgettable jungle holiday.',903,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:28:52.510'),('96c54909-05d0-459f-abc9-dac739ddd13c','rajasthan-jawai-leopard-safari-escape-3d2n','Jawai Leopard Safari Escape','Rajasthan','domestic',2,3,'₹ 15,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785087726416-chatgpt-ima