ocal Sightseeing\", \"Mussoorie &amp; Kempty Falls\", \"Naini Lake Boating\", \"Jim Corbett Jeep Safari\", \"Mall Road Shopping\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Haridwar\", \"detail\": \"Visit Har Ki Pauri, Mansa Devi Temple and witness the evening Ganga Aarti.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Haridwar to Rishikesh &amp; Mussoorie\", \"detail\": \"Explore Rishikesh before proceeding to Mussoorie for overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Mussoorie Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kempty Falls, Gun Hill, Company Garden and Mall Road.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Mussoorie to Nainital\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Nainital and enjoy boating at Naini Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Nainital Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Snow View Point, Naina Devi Temple, Eco Cave Garden and Mall Road.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Nainital to Jim Corbett\", \"detail\": \"Proceed to Jim Corbett and visit Garjia Devi Temple.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Jim Corbett Safari\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy an early morning Jeep Safari and explore the surrounding area.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Return to Haridwar\", \"detail\": \"Drive back to Haridwar with en-route sightseeing and leisure time.\"}, {\"day\": 9, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the very best of Uttarakhand with our Complete Uttarakhand Tour Package, an unforgettable journey that perfectly combines spirituality, scenic hill stations, peaceful lakes, and exciting wildlife adventures.\n\nExplore the sacred cities of Haridwar and Rishikesh, witness the mesmerizing Ganga Aarti, unwind amidst the charming landscapes of Mussoorie, enjoy peaceful boating on Naini Lake, and experience the thrill of a jeep safari in the renowned Jim Corbett National Park. From majestic Himalayan views to vibrant local markets and serene natural surroundings, every destination offers a unique glimpse into the beauty of Dev Bhoomi.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, and first-time visitors, this comprehensive package combines comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing for the ultimate Uttarakhand holiday experience.',2205,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 09:01:44.963'),('98b42ccb-f08d-41ca-9490-edcf2e580b51','maharashtra-mumbai-city-tour-package-3d2n','Mumbai City Tour Package','Maharashtra','domestic',2,3,'₹ 9,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785080262838-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-09-07-30-pm.png','[]','[\"Gateway of India\", \"Marine Drive\", \"Elephanta Caves\", \"Siddhivinayak Temple\", \"Bandra Bandstand\", \"Juhu Beach\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Mumbai\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Mumbai and visit Gateway of India, Colaba Causeway and Marine Drive before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Mumbai Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Elephanta Caves, Siddhivinayak Temple, Bandra Bandstand and Juhu Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the vibrant energy of India\'s financial capital with our Mumbai City Highlights Tour, a perfect blend of iconic landmarks, cultural heritage, bustling streets, and breathtaking coastal views.\n\nExplore Mumbai\'s most famous attractions, including the majestic Gateway of India, the historic Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Terminus, the scenic Marine Drive, the lively Colaba Causeway, and the beautiful Juhu Beach. Visit renowned temples, enjoy panoramic city views, indulge in delicious local street food, and experience the unique charm that makes Mumbai one of India\'s most dynamic destinations.\n\nPerfect for families, couples, and first-time visitors, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for an unforgettable Mumbai experience.',1800,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:37:48.972'),('993e0be7-d6b0-4777-b7b6-81d8685b111f','karnataka-mysore-coorg-kabini-wildlife-tour-trending-6d5n','Mysore – Coorg – Kabini Wildlife Tour','Karnataka','domestic',5,6,'₹ 21,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785074843028-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-36-54-pm.png','[]','[\"Mysore Palace\", \"Abbey Falls\", \"Dubare Elephant Camp\", \"Kabini Jungle Safari\", \"Kabini River Boat Safari\", \"Nagarhole National Park\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Mysore\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Mysore and visit Mysore Palace, Chamundi Hills and Brindavan Gardens.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Mysore to Coorg\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Coorg and explore Abbey Falls, Raja\'s Seat and coffee plantations.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Coorg to Kabini\", \"detail\": \"Visit Dubare Elephant Camp before proceeding to Kabini for leisure.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Kabini Wildlife Safari\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy an early morning Jungle Safari and Kabini River Boat Safari.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Nature &amp; Leisure\", \"detail\": \"Relax at the resort or enjoy bird watching, nature walks and riverside activities.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the perfect combination of royal heritage, scenic hill stations, and thrilling wildlife adventures with our Mysore – Coorg – Kabini Wildlife Tour, one of Karnataka\'s most exciting travel experiences.\n\nExplore the magnificent Mysore Palace, admire the beauty of Chamundi Hills, and unwind amidst the lush coffee plantations and waterfalls of Coorg. Continue your adventure to the pristine wilderness of Kabini, where thrilling jungle safaris, peaceful river boat safaris, and the rich biodiversity of Nagarhole National Park offer unforgettable encounters with elephants, deer, birds, and other wildlife in their natural habitat.\n\nPerfect for families, couples, wildlife enthusiasts, and adventure seekers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and carefully planned experiences for an unforgettable Karnataka getaway.',1703,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 14:07:27.830'),('999bcaac-8291-44b2-8045-c40d4df33dc8','kashmir-kashmir-highlights-tour-5d4n','Kashmir Highlights Tour','Kashmir','domestic',4,5,'₹ 14,499',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785075180180-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-42-43-pm.png','[]','[\"Srinagar Local Sightseeing\", \"Dal Lake Shikara Ride\", \"Sonmarg Excursion\", \"Gulmarg Excursion\", \"Pahalgam Excursion\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Srinagar\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Srinagar, visit Mughal Gardens and enjoy a Shikara Ride on Dal Lake. Overnight stay in Srinagar.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Sonmarg Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore Sonmarg, Sindh River and scenic Himalayan landscapes before returning to Srinagar for an overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Gulmarg Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Visit Gulmarg, enjoy beautiful meadows and the optional Gondola Ride, then return to Srinagar for an overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Pahalgam Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore Betaab Valley, Aru Valley, Chandanwari and the Lidder River before returning to Srinagar.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the breathtaking beauty of the Himalayas with our Kashmir Highlights Tour, a carefully crafted holiday that takes you through the valley\'s most iconic destinations, where snow-capped mountains, lush meadows, crystal-clear rivers, and tranquil lakes create unforgettable memories.\n\nExperience the charm of Srinagar with a peaceful Shikara ride on the famous Dal Lake, explore the picturesque valleys of Sonmarg and Pahalgam, and witness the breathtaking landscapes of Gulmarg, home to one of the world\'s highest gondola rides. From vibrant Mughal Gardens to panoramic Himalayan vistas, every destination showcases the timeless beauty that has earned Kashmir the title of Paradise on Earth.\n\nPerfect for families, couples, and nature lovers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and well-planned sightseeing for a truly memorable Kashmir holiday.',100,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-02 11:38:38.016'),('a1e5ef6f-ba9b-4823-9368-4083ce04d351','odisha-chilika-lake-coastal-escape-5d4n','Chilika Lake & Coastal Escape','Odisha','domestic',4,5,'₹ 18,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785086227480-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-10-46-52-pm.png','[]','[\"Chilika Lake\", \"Irrawaddy Dolphin Cruise\", \"Satapada\", \"Kalijai Temple\", \"Puri Beach\", \"Chandrabhaga Beach\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Bhubaneswar\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Bhubaneswar and transfer to Puri with an evening at Puri Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Chilika Lake Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Visit Satapada, enjoy a boat cruise on Chilika Lake and spot Irrawaddy Dolphins.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Konark Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Konark Sun Temple, Chandrabhaga Beach and Ramachandi Temple.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Puri Local Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Jagannath Temple, local markets and relax by the beach.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed to Bhubaneswar Airport/Railway Station.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the tranquil beauty of Odisha’s coastline on this refreshing getaway filled with scenic lakes, golden beaches, and unique wildlife encounters.\n\nVisit the famous Chilika Lake, Asia’s largest brackish water lagoon, and enjoy an exciting boat ride at Satapada with a chance to spot rare Irrawaddy dolphins. Explore the iconic Konark Sun Temple and unwind at the serene Puri and Chandrabhaga beaches.\n\nFrom peaceful waters to coastal charm, this journey offers a perfect escape into nature and relaxation.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, and nature lovers, this package includes comfortable accommodation,