 carefully planned sightseeing for an extraordinary North Sikkim experience.',601,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-29 14:42:27.278'),('a3f40031-5506-493e-b6c0-091479103944','gujarat-divine-dwarka-somnath-pilgrimage-tour-4d3n','Divine Dwarka Somnath Pilgrimage Tour','Gujarat','domestic',2,3,'₹ 10,499',NULL,NULL,'/images/destinations/1785072826818-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-02-58-pm.png','[]','[\"Dwarkadhish Temple\", \"Somnath Jyotirlinga\", \"Nageshwar Jyotirlinga\", \"Bet Dwarka\", \"Rukmini Devi Temple\", \"Evening Aarti &amp; Light Show\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Somnath\", \"detail\": \"Early morning pickup from Ahmedabad and drive to Somnath. Visit Somnath Jyotirlinga, Triveni Sangam and Bhalka Tirth before attending the evening Aarti. Overnight stay in Somnath.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Somnath to Dwarka\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive to Dwarka. Visit Dwarkadhish Temple, Gomti Ghat and attend the evening Aarti. Overnight stay in Dwarka.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Dwarka Sightseeing &amp; Departure\", \"detail\": \"Visit Bet Dwarka, Nageshwar Jyotirlinga and Rukmini Devi Temple before driving back to Ahmedabad for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on a spiritually enriching journey with our Divine Dwarka Somnath Pilgrimage Tour, a sacred experience that takes you to two of Gujarat\'s most revered pilgrimage destinations, steeped in history, devotion, and timeless traditions.\n\nSeek blessings at the magnificent Dwarkadhish Temple, one of the Char Dham pilgrimage sites, before exploring the sacred Nageshwar Jyotirlinga, Bet Dwarka, Rukmini Devi Temple, and the holy Gomti Ghat. Continue your journey to the revered Somnath Jyotirlinga, where the majestic temple overlooking the Arabian Sea, Triveni Sangam, and Bhalka Tirth offer a deeply spiritual and peaceful experience.\n\nIdeal for pilgrims, families, and spiritual travelers, this package includes comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for a memorable pilgrimage across Gujarat\'s sacred coastline.',1200,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-02 08:53:33.483'),('a44ab1a1-e1af-491a-aa36-64b5957c646b','gujarat-white-rann-of-kutch-cultural-escape-4d3n','White Rann of Kutch Cultural Escape','Gujarat','domestic',3,4,'₹ 16,499',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785073547653-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-15-36-pm.png','[]','[\"White Rann of Kutch\", \"Rann Utsav\", \"Kala Dungar (Black Hill)\", \"India Bridge\", \"Traditional Kutchi Villages\", \"Cultural Performances &amp; Handicrafts\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Ahmedabad to Bhuj\", \"detail\": \"Early morning pickup from Ahmedabad and drive to Bhuj. Visit Aina Mahal, Prag Mahal, Shri Swaminarayan Temple and explore the vibrant Bhuj Local Market. Overnight stay in Bhuj.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Bhuj to Dholavira\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive to Dholavira and explore the UNESCO World Heritage archaeological site. Later, witness the breathtaking sunset at the White Rann. Overnight stay in Dholavira Hotel.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"White Rann &amp; Cultural Experience\", \"detail\": \"Explore the White Rann, enjoy the scenic beauty and experience the rich culture of Kutch with local handicrafts and traditional performances (subject to availability). Overnight stay in a luxury tent at Dholavira.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Departure to Ahmedabad\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive back to Ahmedabad for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the magical beauty of Gujarat\'s iconic white salt desert with our White Rann of Kutch Cultural Escape, a journey that beautifully blends breathtaking landscapes, vibrant traditions, and authentic Kutchi culture.\n\nWitness the spectacular beauty of the White Rann during sunrise and sunset, explore the scenic Kala Dungar, visit the historic India Bridge, and immerse yourself in the colorful celebrations of the world-famous Rann Utsav. Discover traditional Kutchi villages, admire exquisite handicrafts created by local artisans, and enjoy captivating folk music and cultural performances that showcase Gujarat\'s rich heritage.\n\nPerfect for families, photographers, and culture enthusiasts, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for an unforgettable desert experience.',1203,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-02 09:37:42.555'),('a535e1b9-aac6-4f71-9642-8017766f7bc0','complete-assam-explorer-7d6n','Complete Assam Explorer','Assam','domestic',6,7,'₹ 29,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785082084507-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-09-37-52-pm.png','[]','[\"Kamakhya Temple\", \"Kaziranga National Park\", \"Majuli River Island\", \"Assam Tea Gardens\", \"Sivasagar Heritage Monuments\", \"Brahmaputra River Cruise\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Guwahati\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Guwahati and visit Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Temple and Brahmaputra Riverfront.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Guwahati to Kaziranga\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Kaziranga and enjoy an evening exploring nearby tea gardens.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Kaziranga to Majuli\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy a morning jeep safari before travelling to Majuli, the world\'s largest river island.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Majuli Exploration\", \"detail\": \"Visit traditional Satras, local tribal villages and experience Assamese culture.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Majuli to Sivasagar\", \"detail\": \"Explore Rang Ghar, Talatal Ghar, Kareng Ghar and historic Ahom monuments.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Sivasagar to Guwahati\", \"detail\": \"Return to Guwahati and enjoy shopping and an evening Brahmaputra River Cruise.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Guwahati Airport/Railway Station for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the rich heritage and natural beauty of North East India with our Complete Assam Explorer, a comprehensive journey through Assam\'s sacred temples, lush tea estates, vibrant wildlife, river islands, and historic monuments.\n\nSeek blessings at the famous Kamakhya Temple, experience thrilling wildlife encounters in Kaziranga National Park, and explore the serene beauty of Majuli, the world\'s largest river island, known for its unique Satras and vibrant tribal culture. Continue your journey to Sivasagar, where the magnificent Ahom monuments, Rang Ghar, Talatal Ghar, and Kareng Ghar showcase Assam\'s glorious royal heritage. Complete your adventure with a relaxing cruise along the majestic Brahmaputra River while soaking in the region\'s breathtaking landscapes.\n\nPerfect for families, culture enthusiasts, wildlife lovers, and first-time travelers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing, making it the ultimate way to experience the very best of Assam.',402,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-29 14:42:09.339'),('a82092e9-be0c-4ad7-ac8f-2570dd07b2a9','himachal-shimla-manali-tour-package-6d5n','Shimla Manali Tour Package','Himachal Pradesh','domestic',5,6,'₹ 16,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785073916881-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-21-45-pm.png','[]','[\"The Ridge &amp; Mall Road, Shimla\", \"Kufri Sightseeing\", \"Solang Valley\", \"Atal Tunnel / Rohtang Pass\", \"Hadimba Temple\", \"Local Shopping &amp; Adventure Activities\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Shimla\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Shimla and explore Mall Road, The Ridge and Christ Church.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Shimla Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kufri, Jakhoo Temple and local attractions before returning to Shimla.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Shimla to Manali\", \"detail\": \"Drive through the scenic Kullu Valley and visit Pandoh Dam and Kullu Shawl Factory.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Manali Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Hadimba Temple, Vashisht Temple, Club House and Mall Road.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Solang Val