ail\": \"Visit Bharatpur Beach, Natural Bridge and Laxmanpur Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Return to Port Blair\", \"detail\": \"Return by ferry and explore local attractions and shopping.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Port Blair Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Ross Island, North Bay Island and enjoy optional water sports.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Port Blair Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Create unforgettable family memories with our Andaman Family Vacation, a fun-filled island holiday that perfectly blends beautiful beaches, exciting ferry rides, historical attractions, and unforgettable coastal adventures.\n\nExplore the vibrant charm of Port Blair before discovering the tropical beauty of Havelock Island (Swaraj Dweep) and Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep). Relax on the pristine shores of Radhanagar Beach, admire the unique Natural Bridge, visit Bharatpur Beach, and experience the fascinating history of Cellular Jail. Optional water activities and scenic island hopping ensure memorable experiences for travelers of every age.\n\nPerfect for families seeking relaxation and adventure, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, inter-island ferry transfers, and carefully planned sightseeing for a hassle-free island holiday.',1502,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 13:07:37.992'),('ad08cc12-e8cf-4daa-bb67-74aef10dbfcb','andaman-andaman-adventure-scuba-tour-6d5n','Andaman Adventure & Scuba Tour','Andaman Islands','domestic',5,6,'₹ 29,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785071393288-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-06-39-41-pm.png','[]','[\"5 Nights Accommodation\", \"Daily Breakfast\", \"Airport Pickup &amp; Drop\", \"Private AC Vehicle for Sightseeing\", \"Inter-Island Ferry Tickets\", \"Complete Sightseeing as per Itinerary\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Port Blair\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Port Blair and visit Cellular Jail and Corbyn\'s Cove Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Port Blair to Havelock Island\", \"detail\": \"Transfer to Havelock Island and relax at Radhanagar Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Adventure Activities\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy scuba diving, snorkeling and optional sea walk at Elephant Beach.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"North Bay Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Visit North Bay Island and enjoy water sports and island exploration.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Return to Port Blair\", \"detail\": \"Return by ferry and explore local markets and nearby attractions.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Port Blair Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Dive into an unforgettable island adventure with our Andaman Adventure & Scuba Tour, specially designed for travelers seeking thrilling water sports, breathtaking marine life, and spectacular tropical landscapes.\n\nExplore the crystal-clear waters surrounding Havelock Island (Swaraj Dweep), Elephant Beach, and North Bay Island while enjoying exciting experiences such as scuba diving, snorkeling, and optional sea walking. Discover vibrant coral reefs, colorful marine life, and some of India\'s finest underwater destinations before relaxing on the pristine beaches that make Andaman a paradise for adventure lovers.\n\nPerfect for adventure enthusiasts, couples, and water sports lovers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, inter-island ferry transfers, and unforgettable island experiences.',1503,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 13:09:57.333'),('b34a248c-9f9a-43d8-a911-0b3ab22a7930','ladakh-delhi-manali-leh-expedition-10d9n','Delhi – Manali – Leh Expedition','Ladakh','domestic',9,10,'₹ 39,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785078197785-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-09-15-pm.png','[]','[\"Manali–Leh Highway\", \"Atal Tunnel\", \"Sarchu &amp; More Plains\", \"Khardung La Pass\", \"Nubra Valley\", \"Pangong Lake\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Delhi to Manali\", \"detail\": \"Overnight journey from Delhi to Manali by Volvo or private vehicle.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Manali Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Hadimba Temple, Mall Road, Vashisht Temple and local attractions.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Manali to Sarchu\", \"detail\": \"Drive through Atal Tunnel, Baralacha La Pass and scenic Himalayan landscapes.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Sarchu to Leh\", \"detail\": \"Travel via Nakee La, Lachulung La, More Plains and Tanglang La before reaching Leh.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Leh Local Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa, Hall of Fame and Leh Market.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Leh to Nubra Valley\", \"detail\": \"Cross Khardung La Pass and visit Diskit Monastery &amp; Hunder Sand Dunes.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Pangong Lake through the scenic Shyok Route.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Pangong Lake to Leh\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy the sunrise before returning to Leh via Chang La Pass.\"}, {\"day\": 9, \"title\": \"Leh to Delhi\", \"detail\": \"Fly back to Delhi after breakfast with unforgettable memories.\"}, {\"day\": 10, \"title\": \"Tour Ends\", \"detail\": \"Arrival in Delhi marks the end of your incredible Ladakh expedition.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on the adventure of a lifetime with our Delhi – Manali – Leh Expedition, an epic Himalayan road trip that takes you across some of the world\'s highest mountain passes and most breathtaking landscapes.\n\nBegin your journey from Delhi before exploring the charming hill station of Manali and travelling along the legendary Manali–Leh Highway. Cross iconic routes including the Atal Tunnel, Baralacha La, Nakee La, Lachulung La, More Plains, and Tanglang La before reaching the spectacular landscapes of Ladakh. Continue your adventure with visits to Khardung La Pass, Nubra Valley, Pangong Lake, Leh Palace, and Shanti Stupa, creating unforgettable memories at every turn.\