ay.\"}, {\"day\": 9, \"title\": \"Udaipur Leisure &amp; Shopping\", \"detail\": \"Spend the day exploring local markets, handicraft shops and enjoying free time in Udaipur.\"}, {\"day\": 10, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey from Udaipur.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the timeless charm of Rajasthan with our Best of Rajasthan Tour, an unforgettable journey through the state\'s most iconic cities, where magnificent forts, royal palaces, golden deserts, and serene lakes showcase the rich heritage of India\'s Land of Kings.\n\nExplore the royal grandeur of Jaipur, the majestic forts of Jodhpur, the golden landscapes of Jaisalmer, and the romantic lakes of Udaipur. Experience camel safaris across the Sam Sand Dunes, witness vibrant cultural performances, admire architectural masterpieces, and enjoy scenic boat rides on the beautiful Lake Pichola while immersing yourself in Rajasthan\'s colorful traditions and warm hospitality.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, and first-time visitors, this comprehensive package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing, making it the perfect way to experience the very best of Rajasthan.',2104,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 17:40:23.204'),('b4c4e555-6040-471f-8b1f-1bb63f012d64','madhya-pradesh-bandhavgarh-jabalpur-tour-package-5d4n','Bandhavgarh & Jabalpur Wildlife Escape','Madhya Pradesh','domestic',4,5,'₹ 18,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785079617396-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-56-40-pm.png','[]','[\"Bandhavgarh Jungle Safari\", \"Marble Rocks at Bhedaghat\", \"Dhuandhar Waterfall\", \"Boat Ride at Bhedaghat (Optional)\", \"Chausath Yogini Temple\", \"Private Cab for Complete Tour\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Bandhavgarh\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Bandhavgarh, check in to your accommodation and enjoy leisure time amidst nature.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Bandhavgarh Safari\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy an exciting