otion, culture, and tradition.\n\nExplore iconic landmarks such as the Kashi Vishwanath Temple, Sarnath, and the sacred ghats of the Ganges, along with the mesmerizing evening Ganga Aarti.\n\nExperience the deep-rooted spiritual energy, witness ancient rituals, and walk through narrow lanes that reflect the city’s rich heritage and culture.\n\nPerfect for pilgrims, culture lovers, and explorers, this package offers comfortable stays, seamless travel, and thoughtfully curated experiences for a truly soulful journey.',1300,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 09:31:30.061'),('cc5c5d51-45c0-42ef-9df5-5cbe09f905d1','lakshadweep-lakshadweep-family-vacation-5d4n','‍‍‍ Lakshadweep Family Vacation','Lakshadweep','domestic',4,5,'₹ 29,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785078600399-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-39-37-pm.png','[]','[\"Agatti Island\", \"Kavaratti Island\", \"Marine Aquarium\", \"Glass Bottom Boat Ride\", \"Coral Reefs\", \"Beach Activities\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Agatti\", \"detail\": \"Arrive at Agatti Island and relax at your beach resort.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Kavaratti Island Tour\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kavaratti Island, Marine Aquarium and explore the beautiful lagoon.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Water Activities\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy glass-bottom boat rides, optional snorkeling and beach leisure.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Local Island Exploration\", \"detail\": \"Explore Agatti village, local markets and coastal viewpoints.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Agatti Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Create unforgettable family memories with our Lakshadweep Family Vacation, a fun-filled island holiday featuring pristine beaches, crystal-clear lagoons, colorful coral reefs, and exciting marine experiences for travelers of all ages.\n\nExplore the tranquil beauty of Agatti and Kavaratti Islands, visit the fascinating Marine Aquarium, and discover the incredible underwater world through relaxing glass-bottom boat rides. Spend quality time together enjoying beach activities, island sightseeing, peaceful coastal walks, and optional water adventures while soaking in the untouched beauty of Lakshadweep\'s tropical paradise.\n\nPerfect for families seeking relaxation and adventure, this package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless island transfers, and thoughtfully planned sightseeing for a stress-free island holiday.',1602,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:10:04.739'),('cf72cb88-b4e2-4fb5-bf9e-7012092f6c6e','complete-meghalaya-explorer-6d5n','Complete Meghalaya Explorer','Meghalaya','domestic',5,6,'₹ 28,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785084642100-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-10-20-11-pm.png','[]','[\"Umiam Lake\", \"Shillong Peak\", \"Nohkalikai Falls\", \"Mawsmai Cave\", \"Dawki &amp; Umngot River\", \"Mawlynnong &amp; Double Decker Living Root Bridge\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Guwahati – Shillong\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Guwahati and drive to Shillong via Umiam Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Shillong &amp; Cherrapunji\", \"detail\": \"Visit Elephant Falls, Shillong Peak, Nohkalikai Falls, Mawsmai Cave and Seven Sisters Falls.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Dawki &amp; Mawlynnong\", \"detail\": \"Explore Dawki, enjoy boating on the Umngot River and visit Mawlynnong Village.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Living Root Bridge Trek\", \"detail\": \"Trek to the Double Decker Living Root Bridge and visit Rainbow Falls.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Shillong Leisure\", \"detail\": \"Visit Laitlum Canyon, Police Bazaar and enjoy local shopping.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Guwahati Airport/Railway Station for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the very best of Meghalaya with our Complete Meghalaya Explorer, a comprehensive holiday that showcases the state\'s breathtaking waterfalls, crystal-clear rivers, scenic hill station