at and coffee plantations.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Coorg Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Dubare Elephant Camp, Talakaveri and Bhagamandala Temple.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey from Bangalore.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the perfect blend of royal heritage, scenic hill stations, and lush coffee plantations with our Bangalore – Mysore – Coorg Heritage Tour, a memorable journey through Karnataka\'s most iconic destinations.\n\nBegin your adventure in the vibrant city of Bangalore before exploring the grandeur of Mysore Palace, the spiritual charm of Chamundi Hills, and the beautifully illuminated Brindavan Gardens. Continue to the picturesque hills of Coorg, where cascading Abbey Falls, Raja\'s Seat, sprawling coffee plantations, and serene natural landscapes create the perfect escape from city life.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, and heritage enthusiasts, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and carefully planned sightseeing, ensuring a relaxing and unforgettable Karnataka holiday.',1700,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 14:02:07.748'),('dd7baba4-7efc-4385-95b9-d24b1e65a1b4','tamil-nadu-ooty-madurai-family-getaway-5d4n','Ooty – Madurai Family Getaway','Tamil Nadu','domestic',4,5,'₹ 17,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1783014809244-ooty-madurai-family-getaway.png','[]','[\"Ooty Lake\", \"Botanical Garden\", \"Doddabetta Peak\", \"Tea Gardens\", \"Meenakshi Amman Temple\", \"Thirumalai Nayakkar Palace\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Ooty\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Ooty and relax at Ooty Lake while exploring the local market.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Ooty Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Botanical Garden, Rose Garden, Doddabetta Peak and Tea Museum.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Ooty to Madurai\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Madurai and enjoy an evening exploring local markets.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Madurai Sightseeing\", \"