rd Watching\", \"Nature Photography\", \"Moharli Gate Safari Zone\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Tadoba\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Tadoba, check in to the resort and enjoy leisure amidst nature.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Jungle Safari\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy an early morning Jeep Safari and explore the rich wildlife of Tadoba National Park.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Wildlife Exploration\", \"detail\": \"Visit nearby safari zones, nature trails and enjoy bird watching before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the thrill of the wild with our Tadoba Wildlife Safari Tour, an exciting adventure through one of India\'s oldest and most celebrated tiger reserves, renowned for its rich biodiversity and incredible wildlife encounters.\n\nEmbark on thrilling jeep safaris through the dense forests of Tadoba National Park, where you\'ll have the opportunity to spot majestic Bengal tigers, leopards, sloth bears, wild dogs, deer, and a remarkable variety of bird species in their natural habitat. Surrounded by pristine wilderness and scenic landscapes, every safari promises unforgettable moments for nature lovers and photographers alike.\n\nPerfect for wildlife enthusiasts, adventure seekers, families, and photographers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, guided safari experiences, private transportation, and carefully planned sightseeing for an unforgettable jungle adventure.',1804,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:50:15.641'),('e63efad7-ebdd-4530-b218-37b0160e6443','west-bengal-kolkata-shantiniketan-cultural-journey-5d4n','Kolkata – Shantiniketan Cultural Journey','West Bengal','domestic',4,5,'₹ 19,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785228437477-chatgpt-image-jul-28-2026-02-17-05-pm.png','[]','[\"Victoria Memorial\", \"Dakshineswar Kali Temple\", \"Belur Math\", \"Shantiniketan\", \"Visva-Bharati University\", \"Sonajhuri Haat\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Kolkata\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Kolkata and visit Victoria Memorial, Howrah Bridge and Park Street.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Kolkata Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Dakshineswar Temple, Belur Math, Indian Museum and local markets.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Kolkata to Shantiniketan\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Shantiniketan and visit Visva-Bharati University, Tagore Ashram and Kala Bhavana.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Shantiniketan Exploration\", \"detail\": \"Explore Sonajhuri Haat, Amar Kutir and nearby cultural attractions.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, return to Kolkata for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Discover the rich cultural heritage of West Bengal with our Kolkata and Shantiniketan tour, a journey through colonial history and artistic legacy.\n\nExplore iconic landmarks including Victoria Memorial, Dakshineswar Temple, Belur Math, and the culturally vibrant town of Shantiniketan, home to Visva-Bharati University.\n\nImmerse yourself in art, literature, and traditions inspired by Rabindranath Tagore, while experiencing the unique cultural essence of this region.\n\nPerfect for families, culture lovers, and heritage explorers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, smooth transportation, and thoughtfully curated sightseeing for a meaningful cultural experience.',2303,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 08:47:20.295'),('e8a6013b-978f-42a1-aab1-4b32cb08c143','northeast-eastern-himalaya-explorer-8d7n','Eastern Himalaya Explorer','North East India','domestic',7,8,'₹ 34,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785232369285-chatgpt-image-jul-28-2026-03-22-36-pm.png','[]','[\"Gangtok\", \"Tsomgo Lake\", \"Nathula Pass\", \"Darjeeling\", \"Tiger Hill\", \"Kalimpong\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Gangtok\", \"detail\": \"Transfer from Bagdogra/NJP to Gangtok.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Gangtok Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Tsomgo Lake, Baba Mandir and MG Marg.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Gangtok to Darjeeling\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Darjeeling via scenic Himalayan roads.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Darjeeling Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Tiger Hill, Batasia Loop and Ghoom Monastery.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Kalimpong Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore Durpin Monastery, Deolo Hill and local markets.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Leisure Day\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy shopping and optional sightseeing.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Return to Gangtok\", \"detail\": \"Travel back while enjoying Himalayan landscapes.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"Transfer to Bagdogra Airport/NJP Railway Station.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the majestic beauty of the Eastern Himalayas with our Eastern Himalaya Explorer, a scenic journey through the charming hill stations of Gangtok, Darjeeling, and Kalimpong, where snow-capped peaks, peaceful monasteries, and breathtaking landscapes create unforgettable memories.\n\nDiscover the serene beauty of Tsomgo Lake, seek blessings at Baba Mandir, and stroll through the vibrant streets of MG Marg in Gangtok. Witness the spectacular sunrise over Kanchenjunga from Tiger Hill, explore the historic Batasia Loop and Ghoom Monastery in Darjeeling, and unwind amidst the tranquil surroundings of Kalimpong with visits to Deolo Hill and Durpin Monastery.\n\nPerfect for families, honeymooners, couples, and mountain lovers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and carefully planned sightseeing for a memorable Himalayan escape.',801,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 09:52:55.205'),('e8de5bcb-79d5-464a-9d4f-d5c01fd47f89','ladakh-srinagar-kargil-leh-road-trip-8d7n','Srinagar – Kargil – Leh Road Trip','Ladakh','domestic',7,8,'₹ 31,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785078033905-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-30-00-pm.png','[]','[\"Srinagar to Leh Scenic Drive\", \"Zoji La Pass\", \"Kargil War Memorial\", \"Magnetic Hill &amp; Sangam\", \"Leh Palace &amp; Shanti Stupa\", \"Hemis &amp; Thiksey Monastery\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Srinagar\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Srinagar, enjoy local sightseeing and a relaxing Shikara Ride on Dal Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Srinagar to Kargil\", \"detail\": \"Drive through Sonmarg, Zoji La Pass and Drass before reaching Kargil.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Kargil to Leh\", \"detail\": \"Visit Lamayuru Monastery, Magnetic Hill, Sangam and Gurudwara Pathar Sahib en route to Leh.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Leh Local Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa, Hall of Fame and the local market.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Monastery Tour\", \"detail\": \"Visit Hemis Monastery, Thiksey Monastery, Shey Palace and Rancho School.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Leisure &amp; Shopping\", \"detail\": \"Spend the day exploring Leh Market, Tibetan Market and local cafés.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Leh to Srinagar\", \"detail\": \"Drive back towards Srinagar via the beautiful Himalayan route.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey from Srinagar.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience one of the world\'s most spectacular road journeys with our Srinagar – Kargil – Leh Himalayan Road Trip, an unforgettable adventure through Kashmir and Ladakh\'s breathtaking mountain landscapes.\n\nBegin your journey with the serene beauty of Srinagar and a peaceful Shikara ride on Dal Lake before driving across the legendary Zoji La Pass and the historic Kargil War Memorial. Continue through dramatic Himalayan terrain to Leh, where you\'ll explore iconic attractions including Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa, Magnetic Hill, Sangam, and the magnificent Hemis and Thiksey Monasteries. Every stretch of this incredible journey offers panoramic mountain views and unforgettable travel experiences.\n\nIdeal for families, couples, photographers, and road trip enthusiasts, this package includes comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and carefully planned sightseeing for an extraordinary Himalayan adventure.',1002,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:00:38.298'),('ea4ebbce-af53-4721-885a-028449264bf9','himachal-himachal-honeymoon-package-6d5n','Himachal Romantic Escape','Himachal Pradesh','domestic',5,6,'₹ 22,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785070083236-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-06-17-43-pm.png','[]','[\"Romantic Candlelight Dinner\", \"Flower Bed Decoration\", \"Kufri Excursion\", \"Solang Valley\", \"Private Sightseeing Cab\", \"Honeymoon Special Stay\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Shimla\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Shimla, relax and enjoy a romantic evening at Mall Road.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Shimla Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kufri, Jakhoo Temple and enjoy scenic viewpoints.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Shimla to Manali\", \"detail\": \"Drive through Kullu Valley and spend a romantic evening in Manali.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Manali Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Hadimba Temple, Vashisht Temple, Club House and Mall Road.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Solang Valley Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy adventure activities and breathtaking Himalayan views at Solang Valley.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Celebrate your love amidst the breathtaking beauty of the Himalayas with our Himachal Romantic Escape, a thoughtfully curated honeymoon package designed for unforgettable moments in the charming hill stations of Shimla and Manali.\n\nEnjoy romantic walks along Mall Road, admire the scenic beauty of Kufri, and experience the snow-covered landscapes of Solang Valley while creating memories surrounded by majestic mountains and serene valleys. Special honeymoon inclusions such as a romantic candlelight dinner, flower bed decoration, and cozy accommodation make your journey even more memorable.\n\nPerfect for newlyweds and couples, this package combines romance, comfort, scenic sightseeing, and private transportation to create the ideal honeymoon in the heart of Himachal Pradesh.',1102,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 12:48:06.213'),('ea8d256d-fdca-459a-9647-042bc00292ce','gujarat-dwarka-somnath-gir-wildlife-tour-5d4n','Dwarka Somnath & Gir Wildlife Tour','Gujarat','domestic',3,4,'₹ 14,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785073272593-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-07-11-01-pm.png','[]','[\"Dwarkadhish Temple\", \"Somnath Jyotirlinga\", \"Gir National Park Safari\", \"Nageshwar Jyotirlinga\", \"Bet Dwarka\", \"Asiatic Lion Safari\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Ahmedabad to Gir &amp; Somnath\", \"detail\": \"Early morning pickup from Ahmedabad and drive to Gir National Park for an exciting wildlife safari. Later, continue to Somnath and enjoy the spectacular Somnath Light &amp; Sound Show (subject to operational timings) before your overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Somnath to Dwarka\", \"detail\": \"Visit Somnath Jyotirlinga, Triveni Sangam and Bhalka Tirth before driving to Dwarka. Attend the evening Aarti at Dwarkadhish Temple. Overnight stay in Dwarka.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Dwarka Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Dwarkadhish Temple, Bet Dwarka, Nageshwar Jyotirlinga, Rukmini Devi Temple and Gomti Ghat. Overnight stay in Dwarka.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Departure to Ahmedabad\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive back to Ahmedabad for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Experience the perfect blend of spirituality and wildlife with our Dwarka Somnath & Gir Wildlife Tour, a unique journey that combines Gujarat\'s sacred temples with the thrill of exploring the last natural habitat of the majestic Asiatic Lion.\n\nBegin your pilgrimage by visiting the revered Dwarkadhish Temple, Nageshwar Jyotirlinga, Bet Dwarka, and the iconic Somnath Jyotirlinga before venturing into the famous Gir National Park. Enjoy an exciting jungle safari through one of India\'s most celebrated wildlife reserves, where diverse flora and fauna create an unforgettable experience for nature lovers.\n\nPerfect for families, pilgrims, and wildlife enthusiasts, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing for a truly unique Gujarat holiday.',1201,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-08-02 09:19:09.389'),('eb85a98a-4b81-41ad-b44d-181c5ef55ada','lakshadweep-lakshadweep-island-escape-4d3n','Lakshadweep Island Escape','Lakshadweep','domestic',3,4,'₹ 24,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785078374193-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-35-54-pm.png','[]','[\"Agatti Island\", \"Agatti Beach\", \"Lagoon Exploration\", \"Glass Bottom Boat Ride\", \"Coral Reef Viewing\", \"Sunset Beach Walk\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Agatti\", \"detail\": \"Arrive at Agatti Island, check in to your beach resort and enjoy a relaxing evening by the lagoon.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Agatti Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Agatti Island, enjoy a glass-bottom boat ride and optional snorkeling.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Leisure &amp; Water Activities\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy beach leisure, kayaking, swimming and island exploration.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Agatti Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Escape to the untouched beauty of the Arabian Sea with our Lakshadweep Island Escape, a relaxing tropical getaway designed for travelers seeking pristine beaches, crystal-clear lagoons, and peaceful island experiences.\n\nDiscover the breathtaking beauty of Agatti Island, where powder-soft white sand beaches, turquoise waters, and vibrant coral reefs create the perfect setting for relaxation. Enjoy scenic glass-bottom boat rides, explore colorful marine life beneath the crystal-clear lagoons, unwind with peaceful beach walks at sunset, and experience the slow-paced charm of island living surrounded by unspoiled natural beauty.\n\nPerfect for couples, families, and leisure travelers, this package combines comfortable beachfront accommodation, seamless island transfers, and carefully planned sightseeing for a refreshing escape to India\'s hidden tropical paradise.',1600,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:06:20.184'),('ec1c7cdf-31e9-45d9-929c-f4a99d1d18f6','ladakh-complete-ladakh-adventure-tour-8d7n','Complete Ladakh Adventure Tour','Ladakh','domestic',7,8,'₹ 34,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785076988202-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-12-54-pm.png','[]','[\"Khardung La Pass\", \"Nubra Valley\", \"Pangong Lake\", \"Tso Moriri Lake\", \"Hanle Observatory (Optional)\", \"Leh Local Sightseeing\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Leh\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Leh, acclimatize and visit Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Leh Local Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Leh Palace, Hall of Fame, Magnetic Hill, Sangam and nearby attractions.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Leh to Nubra Valley\", \"detail\": \"Drive via Khardung La Pass and visit Diskit Monastery &amp; Hunder Sand Dunes.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake\", \"detail\": \"Travel through the scenic Shyok Route and enjoy an overnight stay near Pangong Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Pangong Lake to Tso Moriri\", \"detail\": \"Drive through the beautiful Changthang region to reach the stunning Tso Moriri Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Tso Moriri to Leh\", \"detail\": \"Return to Leh while enjoying breathtaking Himalayan landscapes along the way.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Leisure &amp; Shopping\", \"detail\": \"Explore Leh Market, Tibetan Market and enjoy free time before departure.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Leh Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on the ultimate Himalayan expedition with our Complete Ladakh Adventure Tour, a thrilling journey that showcases the region\'s most spectacular landscapes, high-altitude lakes, mountain passes, and remote valleys.\n\nExplore the vibrant town of Leh before crossing the legendary Khardung La Pass to reach the breathtaking Nubra Valley. Witness the mesmerizing beauty of Pangong Lake, continue through the pristine Changthang Plateau to the tranquil Tso Moriri Lake, and experience the untouched wilderness that makes Ladakh one of India\'s most extraordinary travel destinations. Along the way, visit ancient monasteries, scenic viewpoints, and charming Himalayan villages that reflect Ladakh\'s rich culture and natural beauty.\n\nPerfect for adventure seekers, road trip enthusiasts, and nature lovers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing for the ultimate Ladakh experience.',1001,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 15:00:14.705'),('f014ea09-4a3f-4223-a473-78b6a7e6aa08','uttar-pradesh-ayodhya-kashi-divine-tour-5d4n','Ayodhya & Kashi Divine Tour','Uttarpradesh','domestic',4,5,'₹ 16,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785231173854-chatgpt-image-jul-28-2026-03-02-40-pm.png','[]','[\"Shri Ram Janmabhoomi\", \"Hanuman Garhi\", \"Kashi Vishwanath Temple\", \"Evening Ganga Aarti\", \"Sarnath\", \"Dashashwamedh Ghat\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Ayodhya\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Ayodhya and visit Shri Ram Janmabhoomi, Hanuman Garhi and Kanak Bhawan.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Ayodhya to Varanasi\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Varanasi and attend the evening Ganga Aarti at Dashashwamedh Ghat.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Varanasi Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kashi Vishwanath Temple, Kaal Bhairav Temple and Sarnath.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Local Exploration\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy a sunrise boat ride on the Ganges and explore local markets and temples.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Step into the divine city of Ayodhya with our spiritual tour, a peaceful journey into the birthplace of Lord Shri Ram and one of India’s most sacred destinations.\n\nExplore revered sites, including the holy Shri Ram Janmabhoomi, Hanuman Garhi, and Kanak Bhawan, while experiencing the spiritual atmosphere that defines this ancient city.\n\nWitness the serene banks of the Saryu River, attend soulful aartis, and immerse yourself in centuries-old traditions and devotion.\n\nPerfect for pilgrims, families, and spiritual seekers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, smooth transportation, and well-planned sightseeing for a calm and fulfilling experience.',1301,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 09:32:57.099'),('f1d05507-c552-4fef-aeb9-72738ab4a5b9','complete-arunachal-explorer-featured-package-7d6n','Complete Arunachal Explorer','Arunachal Pradesh','domestic',6,7,'₹ 33,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785085575120-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-10-36-01-pm.png','[]','[\"Bomdila\", \"Dirang Valley\", \"Tawang Monastery\", \"Sela Pass\", \"Madhuri Lake\", \"Jaswant Garh War Memorial\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Guwahati – Bomdila\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Guwahati and drive to Bomdila through scenic mountain roads.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Bomdila to Dirang\", \"detail\": \"Visit Bomdila Monastery and explore Dirang Valley.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Dirang to Tawang\", \"detail\": \"Cross the spectacular Sela Pass and visit Jaswant Garh before reaching Tawang.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Tawang Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Tawang Monastery, Tawang War Memorial and local markets.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Madhuri Lake Excursion\", \"detail\": \"Explore Madhuri Lake and the Bum La route (subject to permit).\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Return to Bomdila\", \"detail\": \"Drive back via Sela Pass and enjoy scenic Himalayan views.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed to Guwahati Airport/Railway Station for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on the ultimate Himalayan adventure with our Complete Arunachal Explorer, a comprehensive journey through the breathtaking mountains, peaceful monasteries, high-altitude lakes, and untouched valleys of the Land of the Rising Sun.\n\nDiscover the spiritual charm of Bomdila Monastery, explore the picturesque Dirang Valley, and cross the spectacular Sela Pass, where breathtaking Himalayan vistas await at every turn. Visit the iconic Tawang Monastery, pay tribute at the historic Jaswant Garh War Memorial, and witness the mesmerizing beauty of Madhuri Lake (Sangetsar Lake), surrounded by dramatic mountain landscapes. Every destination offers a perfect blend of natural beauty, history, and rich Buddhist culture.\n\nPerfect for families, couples, adventure seekers, and first-time visitors, this package combines comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing, making it the ultimate way to experience the untouched beauty of Arunachal Pradesh.',702,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-29 14:42:59.566'),('f2e01b50-6116-4528-af3b-057cebceff8b','uttarakhand-nainital-honeymoon-package-4d3n','Nainital Romantic Escape','Uttarakhand','domestic',3,4,'₹ 15,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785229136965-chatgpt-image-jul-28-2026-02-28-46-pm.png','[]','[\"Romantic Naini Lake Boating\", \"Snow View Point\", \"Tiffin Top\", \"Naina Devi Temple\", \"Mall Road Shopping\", \"Candle Light Dinner (Optional)\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Nainital\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Nainital, enjoy boating at Naini Lake and explore Mall Road before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Nainital Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Snow View Point, Tiffin Top, Naina Devi Temple and Eco Cave Garden.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Leisure &amp; Shopping\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy leisure time, local cafés and shopping at Mall Road before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Celebrate your love amidst the tranquil beauty of Uttarakhand with our Nainital Romantic Escape, a charming honeymoon getaway surrounded by serene lakes, misty mountains, and breathtaking landscapes.\n\nEnjoy romantic boat rides on the picturesque Naini Lake, admire panoramic Himalayan views from Snow View Point and Tiffin Top, seek blessings at the revered Naina Devi Temple, and spend leisurely evenings exploring the vibrant cafés and markets along Mall Road. Cozy accommodation and thoughtfully curated honeymoon experiences create the perfect setting for unforgettable moments together.\n\nDesigned especially for honeymooners and couples, this package combines scenic sightseeing, comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and romantic experiences for a memorable escape in the heart of the Kumaon Hills.',2203,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 08:59:00.512'),('f738ce28-c42a-4655-9641-cd9220db8b5e','kerala-complete-kerala-kanyakumari-grand-tour-9d8n','Kerala Heritage & Coastal Escape','Kerala','domestic',8,9,'₹ 34,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785076639363-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-08-07-10-pm.png','[]','[\"Kochi\", \"Munnar Tea Gardens\", \"Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary\", \"Alleppey Houseboat Stay\", \"Kovalam Beach\", \"Padmanabhaswamy Temple\", \"Vivekananda Rock Memorial\", \"Thiruvalluvar Statue\", \"Kanyakumari Sunrise &amp; Sunset\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Kochi\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Kochi and explore Fort Kochi, Chinese Fishing Nets and Marine Drive.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Kochi to Munnar\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Munnar via waterfalls and tea plantations.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Munnar Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Eravikulam National Park, Tea Museum, Mattupetty Dam and Echo Point.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Munnar to Thekkady\", \"detail\": \"Explore Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary, boating and Spice Plantation.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Thekkady to Alleppey\", \"detail\": \"Enjoy a relaxing houseboat cruise through the famous Kerala backwaters.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Alleppey to Kovalam\", \"detail\": \"Visit Kovalam Beach and Lighthouse Beach while enjoying the coastal beauty.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Kovalam to Kanyakumari\", \"detail\": \"Explore Vivekananda Rock Memorial, Thiruvalluvar Statue and witness the spectacular sunset.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Kanyakumari to Trivandrum\", \"detail\": \"Visit Padmanabhaswamy Temple, Napier Museum and enjoy local shopping.\"}, {\"day\": 9, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, transfer to Trivandrum Airport for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on an unforgettable journey through South India with our Complete Kerala & Kanyakumari Grand Tour, a comprehensive holiday that showcases Kerala\'s breathtaking landscapes along with the iconic coastal beauty of Kanyakumari.\n\nExplore the charming streets of Kochi, wander through Munnar\'s rolling tea gardens, discover the wildlife of Thekkady, and relax aboard a traditional Alleppey houseboat. Continue your journey to the golden beaches of Kovalam before witnessing the spectacular sunrise and sunset at Kanyakumari, while visiting renowned landmarks such as Vivekananda Rock Memorial, Thiruvalluvar Statue, and the sacred Padmanabhaswamy Temple.\n\nPerfect for families, couples, honeymooners, and leisure travelers, this grand tour offers premium accommodation, comfortable transportation, carefully planned sightseeing, and unforgettable experiences, making it the ultimate way to explore the very best of Kerala and South India.',305,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-26 14:37:21.754'),('f9471272-fa1e-4cfd-9c65-f6c192b883b5','kerala-munnar-tea-hills-escape-4d3n','Munnar Tea Hills Escape','Kerala','domestic',3,4,'₹ 13,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1783016518060-munnar-tea-hills-escape.png','[]','[\"Munnar Tea Gardens\", \"Eravikulam National Park\", \"Mattupetty Dam\", \"Echo Point\", \"Kundala Lake\", \"Tea Museum\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Kochi – Munnar\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Kochi and drive to Munnar while visiting Cheeyappara &amp; Valara Waterfalls.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Munnar Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Explore Eravikulam National Park, Tea Museum, Mattupetty Dam, Echo Point and Kundala Lake.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Leisure in Munnar\", \"detail\": \"Visit Blossom Park, local tea estates and enjoy shopping at Munnar Market.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive back to Kochi for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Escape to the breathtaking hill station of Munnar with our carefully curated Munnar Tea Hills Escape, where mist-covered mountains, endless tea plantations, cascading waterfalls, and refreshing mountain air create the perfect holiday retreat.\n\nExplore Kerala\'s most iconic attractions including the lush Munnar Tea Gardens, Eravikulam National Park, Mattupetty Dam, Echo Point, Kundala Lake, and the renowned Tea Museum. Witness spectacular landscapes, enjoy peaceful nature walks, discover scenic viewpoints, and immerse yourself in the tranquil charm of Kerala\'s most loved hill station.\n\nPerfect for honeymooners, couples, and leisure travelers, this package combines comfortable accommodation, delicious meals, seamless transportation, and unforgettable sightseeing to deliver a refreshing and memorable escape amidst nature.',300,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-25 10:55:13.638'),('f98e8029-0952-4984-b332-727781a94245','meghalaya-nature-adventure-5d4n','Meghalaya Nature Adventure','Meghalaya','domestic',4,5,'₹ 22,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785084506410-chatgpt-image-jul-26-2026-10-18-07-pm.png','[]','[\"Dawki River\", \"Umngot River Boating\", \"Mawlynnong Village\", \"Double Decker Living Root Bridge\", \"Rainbow Falls\", \"Krang Suri Waterfall\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Arrival in Shillong\", \"detail\": \"Arrive in Shillong via Umiam Lake and explore the local market.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Dawki &amp; Mawlynnong\", \"detail\": \"Visit Dawki, enjoy boating on the Umngot River and explore Mawlynnong Village.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Living Root Bridge Trek\", \"detail\": \"Trek to the Double Decker Living Root Bridge and visit Rainbow Falls.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Krang Suri Waterfall\", \"detail\": \"Explore Krang Suri Waterfall and nearby scenic viewpoints before returning to Shillong.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, drive back to Guwahati for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on an unforgettable adventure with our Meghalaya Nature Adventure, a thrilling journey through crystal-clear rivers, living root bridges, breathtaking waterfalls, and some of North East India\'s most spectacular natural wonders.\n\nExperience the magical beauty of the Umngot River in Dawki, where the transparent waters create the illusion of boats floating in the air. Explore the charming village of Mawlynnong, trek to the famous Double Decker Living Root Bridge, witness the stunning Rainbow Falls, and relax amidst the turquoise waters of Krang Suri Waterfall. Every destination offers an unforgettable blend of adventure and natural beauty.\n\nIdeal for adventure seekers, photographers, couples, and nature enthusiasts, this package offers comfortable accommodation, seamless transportation, and expertly planned sightseeing for an extraordinary Meghalaya experience.',501,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-29 14:41:37.261'),('fb67d015-e168-49a3-b6d7-ee1a5e5f6eec','uttarakhand-char-dham-yatra-package-10d9n','Char Dham Yatra Package','Uttarakhand','domestic',9,10,'₹ 29,999',NULL,NULL,'/images/packages/1785229209021-chatgpt-image-jul-28-2026-02-29-57-pm.png','[]','[\"Yamunotri Temple\", \"Gangotri Temple\", \"Kedarnath Temple\", \"Badrinath Temple\", \"Mana Village\", \"Evening Ganga Aarti at Haridwar\"]','[]','[{\"day\": 1, \"title\": \"Haridwar to Barkot\", \"detail\": \"Begin your journey from Haridwar and drive to Barkot via Mussoorie.\"}, {\"day\": 2, \"title\": \"Yamunotri Darshan\", \"detail\": \"Trek to Yamunotri Temple for darshan and return to Barkot.\"}, {\"day\": 3, \"title\": \"Barkot to Uttarkashi\", \"detail\": \"Drive to Uttarkashi and visit the famous Kashi Vishwanath Temple.\"}, {\"day\": 4, \"title\": \"Gangotri Darshan\", \"detail\": \"Visit Gangotri Temple and return to Uttarkashi for overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 5, \"title\": \"Uttarkashi to Guptkashi\", \"detail\": \"Drive through scenic Himalayan valleys to Guptkashi.\"}, {\"day\": 6, \"title\": \"Kedarnath Darshan\", \"detail\": \"Trek or take helicopter (optional) for Kedarnath Temple darshan.\"}, {\"day\": 7, \"title\": \"Guptkashi to Badrinath\", \"detail\": \"Proceed to Badrinath and attend the evening temple aarti.\"}, {\"day\": 8, \"title\": \"Badrinath Sightseeing\", \"detail\": \"Visit Mana Village, Vyas Gufa and Bhim Pul before overnight stay.\"}, {\"day\": 9, \"title\": \"Badrinath to Haridwar\", \"detail\": \"Return to Haridwar via Rudraprayag and Devprayag.\"}, {\"day\": 10, \"title\": \"Departure\", \"detail\": \"After breakfast, proceed for your onward journey.\"}]',1,0,NULL,'Embark on one of India\'s most sacred pilgrimages with our Char Dham Yatra Package, a spiritually enriching journey covering the four revered Himalayan shrines of Yamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath.\n\nTravel through breathtaking mountain landscapes, peaceful river valleys, and ancient pilgrimage towns while experiencing the divine atmosphere of Uttarakhand\'s most significant temples. Along the way, visit the holy town of Haridwar, witness the mesmerizing Ganga Aarti, explore the last Indian village of Mana, and discover revered sites such as Vyas Gufa and Bhim Pul that hold immense spiritual and historical significance.\n\nPerfect for pilgrims and spiritual travelers, this package offers comfortable accommodation, private transportation, and well-organized arrangements, ensuring a safe, meaningful, and memorable Char Dham pilgrimage.',2204,'2026-07-02 04:57:50.606','2026-07-28 09:00:12.433');
